<title>USA: Mercury Asset cuts Pioneer stake.</title>
<headline>Mercury Asset cuts Pioneer stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A unit of London-based Mercury Asset Management Group Plc said Wednesday it cut its stake in The Pioneer Group Inc to 1,614,390 common shares, or 6.47 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Mercury said it sold 254,620 shares between September 26 and November 15 at prices ranging from $25 to $26.375 a share.</p>
</text>
